    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>指路：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66f24cbb2adfe48b83041c01" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66f24cbb2adfe48b83041c01"><span>巴塞罗那上期</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>存货again 这是每天剪一点点 靠零碎的时间完成的一期 好像有一种可以让上班的日子过得更快一些的感觉 哈哈哈</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪完这一期又把我的思绪带回去年8月的暑假 在巴塞罗那我们仿佛跌入了彩色的奇幻世界</span></p><span></span><p><span>话不多说 上图</span></p><span></span><p><span>【圣家堂：阳光是最好的画师】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlD3eim94x4c43Yn9yE-38QL1Bjj.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【文森之家：外立面贴着黄色金盏花的瓷砖】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqrAywgkR2MAqQDZ0HlV8QLo06v6.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【文森之家：播客里提到的可以呆一下午的阳台】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh1brngIsP--aX2J-6AqmvnEfXN3.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【米拉之家：通风口护卫队】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fos8_8arzbbBIP9bSbVExdDV7wl-.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【巴特罗之家：海洋世界】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn8XwNOGrknAFD62deiQ9fzutdzk.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【加泰罗尼亚音乐宫：手握响板的少女】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlZUW_L7xsqKDCeJ9P2ehFTNAk0K.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【加泰罗尼亚音乐宫：华丽的顶灯】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgvve0fvTDI9lXE5muJt4Dkv6A1o.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【下面请欣赏：格拉西亚节】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjEH37oxxAvhto6RazQSsle3WO03.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiRLCkfts8DRlqJSWsjDTG4EqZGK.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fikp2zCQvqiUao-3-x2qPwVD9I_Q.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmNkiZDvcRqlRZjh8ICMrF7zvTfw.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs8GiGgjrFE1-w3ShN2Xrwfshc3q.jpg"></figure><s